  triage:closedAt "2026-08-17T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:closedNote "Fixed on plan/search-indexing-admission-performance (commit b7004f67e, PR #891): all three occurrences corrected to bare `reindex-search` with no CLI-ownership claim (crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/lib.rs:785, docs/adr/ADR-049-durable-idle-search-projection.md:53, sprint-AQ1-durable-idle-search-projection.md:46,194). ADR-049 lines 83-87 explicitly state future CLI ownership belongs to the CLI/core layer, not atm-storage-rusqlite. Confirmed independently by req-qa, arch-qa, and ruthless-boundary-qa." ;
